{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Native widgets use read-only providers. Weather requires explicit coordinates. Command output, terminal and shortcut commands execute with your user permissions. Only enable commands you trust. QML manifests resolve through an explicitly trusted host registry. A manifest is not a sandbox.",
  "widgets": [
    {
